meta {
  name: Set GM level
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts/actions
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "accountId": {{targetAccountId}},
    "action": "gmlevel",
    "level": 3
  }
}

docs {
  Levels 0–3, applied to all realms. Level 0 deletes the `account_access` row.
  Level 3 is what the admin panel and the shop's SOAP account require.

  The server refuses to lower your own level below 3, so you cannot lock
  yourself out of the admin panel with this.
}
